"WorldSEO": {
  "title": "Discover the world's beaches",
  "paragraph1": "The world is home to an incredible variety of beaches, from tropical white sands to rugged volcanic shores. Whether you're dreaming of quiet lagoons, palm-lined coasts, or iconic tourist destinations, our global beach database helps you find the perfect spot.",
